<title>IRAN: IRAN STATE TEA ORGANISATION ISSUES TENDER.</title>
<headline>IRAN STATE TEA ORGANISATION ISSUES TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>TEHRAN 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran's State Tea Organisation (STO) has issued an international tender notice for the purchase of tea, an STO advertisement said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The State Tea Organisation of the Islamic Republic of Iran is considering the purchase of 2,000 metric tonnes of tea in packets of 500 grammes of STD STO1 Grade TGFOP and 2,000 metric tonnes of bulk tea,&quot; STO said in a notice published in the local Iran News newspaper.</p>
<p>Bids close on September 20, STO said.</p>
</text>
